---
description: AskIt source and client startup instructions
alwaysApply: true
---

In the AskIt source repository, read `AGENTS.md` first. Its self-development rule controls whether the kit workflow is enabled.

In an installed client, if the session-start hook did not supply workflow context, read and follow `.agents/ask/session.md` before starting or resuming work. Use its linked policies and stage contracts.

Protocol source of truth is `.agents/ask/`; `_ask/` holds scripts, policies, and documentation. This rule is a startup pointer.
